# .percolate-ignore for the coordinator-claude-publish-repo-docs flat-mirror target.
#
# Source: dist/publish-repo-docs/  →  dest: <publish-repo>/docs/  (top-level files only).
#
# Files listed here are protected in BOTH directions:
#   Phase 1 (src→dst): not synced from source (we don't carry them in dist/).
#   Phase 2 (dst delete-not-in-source): protected from deletion in the publish repo's docs/.
#
# WHY THIS LIST IS LONG: flat-mirror deletes any top-level file in the dest that
# the source doesn't have (publish_sync.py sync_flat_mirror Phase 2). Today this
# corner controls exactly ONE file — agent-install.md. Every other top-level
# *.md in the publish repo's docs/ is still authored publish-repo-side and is
# NOT back-percolated here yet; each must be listed below or it would be wiped on
# the next publish. Subdirectories (decisions/, evolution/, plans/, research/,
# specs/, wiki/) are auto-protected — flat-mirror only touches top-level files,
# and docs/wiki/ has its own dedicated target (coordinator-claude-toplevel-wiki).
#
# When a docs/ file graduates to Claude-Central-authored, move it into this dir
# and delete its line below.

# Source-side control files — skipped in Phase 1 (not synced) and protected in Phase 2 (not deleted).
# (agent-install.md, the one file we DO control, is intentionally absent here — it syncs.)
.percolate-ignore
README-meta.md

# Publish-side install-provenance sentinel — written by publish.sh (install-sentinel-write)
# at the END of each target sync. Protect from the Phase-2 delete/recreate churn.
version.txt

# Publish-repo-authored docs/ files (not yet back-percolated; protect from deletion).
README.md
architecture.md
ci-pipeline.md
contracts.md
customization.md
getting-started.md
gitignore-policy.md
pretooluse-deny-contract.md
safety.md
